IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `spr-part7-overseas`

-- Tests for regulations 21 to 23 (spr-part7-overseas.l4).
-- Expected values are decided from the text of the regulation named beside each
-- group, before running. "Overseas resident" is a fact the person states (the 2014 Act
-- defines it; it is not an input here).

§ `Fixtures for regulation 21`
`not deferred, entitled and overseas` MEANS OverseasFacts WITH
    `regulations have been made providing that regulation 21 applies to this up-rating increase` IS TRUE
    `the date the up-rating increase comes into force` IS YMD 2027 4 1
    `the period of deferral, if the person's entitlement was ever deferred` IS NOTHING
    `when the deferral period ended the person was entitled to a state pension under Part 1 of the 2014 Act` IS FALSE
    `when the deferral period ended the person was an overseas resident` IS FALSE
    `the person is entitled to a state pension under Part 1 of the 2014 Act immediately before the increase comes into force` IS TRUE
    `the person is an overseas resident at the time the increase comes into force` IS TRUE
    `the person continued to be an overseas resident until the deferral period ended` IS FALSE
